Subject: [PATCH] ui: remove browsing cutout gutter and animate category
 indicator

Keep browsing content behind side cutouts while preserving side navigation-button insets and explicit detail insets. Animate a single category underline over measured tab positions. Add rotation/inset geometry and unequal tab width regressions. Anikku also gains the optional shaped-column readability floor required by timeline panorama; existing library defaults stay unchanged.
